# Xyne Desk seeded ticket
> Read-only checks on the baseline Desk channel and ticket seeded during bootstrap.

## Seeded customer email is listed and readable as a Desk ticket
* Using browser
* Ensuring user "admin-1" is logged in
* Opening Desk ticket "ticket-desk-baseline" in channel "channel-desk-1" for user "admin-1"
* Verifying open Desk ticket "ticket-desk-baseline" shows its customer email for user "admin-1"

## Desk channel offers Ask AI and compose controls
* Using browser
* Ensuring user "admin-1" is logged in
* Opening Desk channel "channel-desk-1" for user "admin-1"
* verifying "[data-track-name='OPEN_XYNE_AI']" is visible
* verifying "[data-track-name='OpenComposeEmail']" is visible
